  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): inspection confirms WI-tukif-fuhug (the \"catalog completion\" umbrella) is a different artifact (LANGUAGE catalogs with stdlib_provenance YAML files); this item correctly stands alone. Verified: 158 register_analyzer decorator calls under packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src and hypergumbo-lang-extended1/src, zero pass description= — the gap is real and the fix is mechanical (description: str = \"\" default in registry.py:145; extra ts_pack analyzers fill it via the _ts helper in catalog.py:258-261 and core analyzers do not)."  # 7706
